From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rnsbox <rnsbox@localhost>
Date: Fri, 17 Oct 2026 00:20:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 0034] u-boot: bootm the FIT via its default configuration,
 not #config-FDT_NO

Same change as the licheerv-nano series carries: the sdboot env ends in
"bootm ${uImage_addr}#config-${FDT_NO}" where FDT_NO is
__stringify(CVICHIP) "_" __stringify(CVIBOARD) - but CVICHIP is not
defined anywhere in this SDK's u-boot build, so the requested config
name does not match the one the ramdisk FIT actually carries
(config-<board>, mkimage's own substitution). Even with a readable SD
the boot would then die at the very last step.

Every RNSBox FIT carries exactly ONE configuration (the board's), and
u-boot's fit_find_config falls back to the first entry when no #config
is named - so drop the suffix and let the default configuration boot.

---
diff --git a/u-boot-2021.10/include/configs/mars-asic.h b/u-boot-2021.10/include/configs/mars-asic.h
index 0d8661d..531b469 100644
--- a/u-boot-2021.10/include/configs/mars-asic.h
+++ b/u-boot-2021.10/include/configs/mars-asic.h
@@ -271,7 +271,7 @@
 					"  bootm ${uImage_addr}#config-" FDT_NO ";" \
 					"fi;"
 	#else
-		#define UBOOT_VBOOT_BOOTM_COMMAND "bootm ${uImage_addr}#config-" FDT_NO ";"
+		#define UBOOT_VBOOT_BOOTM_COMMAND "bootm ${uImage_addr};"
 	#endif
 
 	/* BOOTLOGO */
diff --git a/u-boot-2021.10/include/configs/phobos-asic.h b/u-boot-2021.10/include/configs/phobos-asic.h
index f18f8f1..6a92014 100644
--- a/u-boot-2021.10/include/configs/phobos-asic.h
+++ b/u-boot-2021.10/include/configs/phobos-asic.h
@@ -265,7 +265,7 @@
 					"  bootm ${uImage_addr}#config-" FDT_NO ";" \
 					"fi;"
 	#else
-		#define UBOOT_VBOOT_BOOTM_COMMAND "bootm ${uImage_addr}#config-" FDT_NO ";"
+		#define UBOOT_VBOOT_BOOTM_COMMAND "bootm ${uImage_addr};"
 	#endif
 
 	/* BOOTLOGO */
2.43.0

